sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Usuario/Planner
    participant C as Capability Manager
    participant W as Workflow Engine
    participant I as Inventory Action
    participant A as Analysis Action
    participant K as Knowledge Graph
    participant E as Event Bus
    U->>C: storage.disk-analysis
    C->>W: workflow validado 1.0.0
    W->>E: workflow.started
    W->>I: leer inventario público
    I-->>W: discos sanitizados
    W->>A: analizar evidencia
    A-->>W: resumen y hallazgos
    W->>K: upsert discos/particiones
    K->>E: knowledge.graph.updated
    W->>E: capability.completed
    W-->>U: resultado sin Actions ni Tools
